  "claim": "Stand By Me, famously starring Florida native River Phoenix, was a film adapted from a short story called The Body, by Stephen King.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Body (King novella). Sentence: The Body is a novella by American writer Stephen King, originally published in his 1982 collection \"Different Seasons\" and adapted into the 1986 film \"Stand by Me\".\nPage: Stand by Me (film). Sentence: The film, whose plot is based on Stephen King's novella \"The Body\" (1982) and title is derived from Ben E. King's eponymous song, which plays over the ending credits, tells the story of four boys in a small town in Oregon who go on a hike to find the dead body of a missing child.",
