        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen King, Ben E. King\n- Works: The Body, Different Seasons, Stand by Me\n- Places: Oregon\n- Topics: novella-to-film adaptation, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen King wrote the novella The Body, which was originally published in 1982 in his collection Different Seasons.\n- The 1986 film Stand by Me was adapted from Stephen King's 1982 novella The Body.\n- The title of the film Stand by Me was derived from Ben E. King's song of the same name, which plays over the ending credits.\n- Stand by Me tells the story of four boys in a small town in Oregon who go on a hike to find the dead body of a missing child.",
